{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224343","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224343","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1622434301:1":{"text":"점점 더 늘어나고 있어. 젤카! 날 수 있는 녀석들을 데리고 먼저 가. 내가 남아서 시간을 벌게!","source_cn":"啾啾！这些家伙越来越多了！瑟卡！你带着能飞的先走！我留...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB77DE5C384488758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1622434302:1":{"text":"안 돼! 가도 같이 가고, 남아도 같이 남아야지. 우리는 한 몸이라고!","source_cn":"不行！要么一起飞走，要么一起留下！鸟群是一个整体！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD20D1D6EB69FD12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1622434303:1":{"text":"끼룩... 그러니까 누군가는 책임을 져야 해. 얼른 가!","source_cn":"啾……正因为是一个整体，才需要有鸟承担错误！快走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE930F8AE0AAF0AC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布尔":{"text":"부르","source":"布尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑟卡":{"text":"젤카","source":"瑟卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}